sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Aggregator
    participant D as SQLite journal
    participant C as Registry
    participant V as Auditor
    A->>D: Persist reading and intent
    A->>D: Persist signed transaction identity
    A->>C: Broadcast once
    C-->>A: Receipt or uncertain response
    A->>C: Check commitment / reconcile
    A->>D: Record confirmed, failed or uncertain
    V->>V: Validate manifest and deployment
    V->>D: Read every expected identity using read-only snapshot
    V->>C: Read commitment at fixed block
    V-->>V: Explained outcome and evidence
